        "html": "<table><tr><td>Description of the strategy</td><td>Equations involving $m_{0}$ and $m_{N}$</td></tr><tr><td>(i) Clamped cubic spline: specify $S^{\\prime }(x_{0})$, $S^{\\prime }(x_{n})$(the “best choice\" if the derivatives are known)</td><td>$m_{0}=\\frac {3}{h_{0}}(d_{0}\\quad S^{\\prime }(x_{0}))\\frac {m_{1}}{2}$$m_{N}=\\frac{3}{h_{N\\quad1}}(S^{\\prime}(x_{N})\\quad d_{N\\quad1})\\quad\\frac{m_{N\\quad1}}{2}$</td></tr><tr><td>(ii) Natural cubic spline(a\"relaxed curve\")</td><td>$m_{0}=0,m_{N}=0$</td></tr><tr><td>(iii) Extrapolate $S^{\\prime \\prime }(x)$to the<br/>endpoints</td><td>$m_{0}=m_{1}\\quad\\frac {h_{0}(m_{2}\\quad m_{1})}{h_{1}},$$m_{N}=m_{N\\quad1}+\\frac{h_{N\\quad1}(m_{N\\quad1}\\quad m_{N\\quad2})}{h_{N\\quad2}}$</td></tr><tr><td>(iv) $S^{\\prime \\prime }(x)$ is constant near the<br/>endpoints</td><td>$m_{0}=m_{1},m_{N}=m_{N\\quad1}$</td></tr><tr><td>(v) Specify $S^{\\prime \\prime }(X)$ at each<br/>endpoint</td><td>$m_{0}=S^{\\prime \\prime }(x_{0}),m_{N}=S^{\\prime \\prime }(x_{N})$</td></tr></table>"
